order-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31934,31913,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (31934, 31913, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Banker</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15.24.95dcf3<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">March 17, 2026<br/>Targuna Update</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20260321204009&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Adrian_c88412.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Adrian.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Deposit your money here!</li><li>I will take care of all your financial matters with complete confidence.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Targuna\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This NPC has no notes.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Adrian.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hi<br/>\nAdrian: Welcome to the Tibian <b>bank</b>, adventurer! <b>Deposit</b> your gold or <b>withdraw</b> your money from your bank account.<br/>\nPlayer: name<br/>\nAdrian: My name is Adrian.<br/>\nPlayer: job<br/>\nAdrian: I`m the banker here in <b>Targuna</b>. It's my job to manage your bank account and change currencies.<br/>\nPlayer: bank<br/>\nAdrian: We can <b>change</b> money for you. You can also access your <b>bank account</b> or your <b>guild</b> account options.<br/>\nPlayer: gold<br/>\nAdrian: You have some gold you want to <b>deposit</b> or <b>withdraw</b>, just tell me.<br/>\nPlayer: shop<br/>\nAdrian: I neither sell nor buy anything here. You can visit <b>Aurelia'</b>s shop to do so. You can find her in the building over here. I can only assist you with <b>bank</b> related things.<br/>\nPlayer: time<br/>\nAdrian: It is exactly <i>time</i>.<br/>\nPlayer: quest<br/>\nAdrian: I'm just a banker. But ask around, maybe someone else could need your help.<br/>\nPlayer: island<br/>\nAdrian: If you enjoy the life outside of busy cities, you've come to the right place.<br/>\nPlayer: main<br/>\nAdrian: This is the main continent of Tibia. You can talk to <b>Indigo</b> if you seek a passage for the Mainland.<br/>\nPlayer: Targuna<br/>\nAdrian: This is our little island here. We are just a small community, but we have good trade relations with the <b>Thais</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: Thais<br/>\nAdrian: Thais is our beautiful capital, ruled by our beloved king <b>Tibianus</b> III.<br/>\nPlayer: Adrian<br/>\nAdrian: Yes?<br/>\nPlayer: Aurelia<br/>\nAdrian: My wife Aurelia runs a small shop here in the town. You can buy useful things for your adventures, but also sell things you might not need any longer. You will find her shop in the south of the town.<br/>\nPlayer: Camilla<br/>\nAdrian: She is our mayor so to say.<br/>\nPlayer: Indigo<br/>\nAdrian: She often sails to <b>Thais</b>. You can find her on her ship at the eastern shore.<br/>\nPlayer: Leonora<br/>\nAdrian: She runs the post office here in <b>Targuna</b>. You can find her north of the depot.<br/>\nPlayer: King<br/>\nAdrian: Our king is Tibianus III. He resides in the capital <b>Thais</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: Tibianus<br/>\nAdrian: Yes, he's our king. He resides in the capital <b>Thais</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: farewell / bye<br/>\nAdrian: Farewell.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Adrian</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":31934,"y":31913,"z":7}}